<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-wrapper {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.bg_color }};
    padding: 100px 5rem;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-header h2 {
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-item {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.item_bg_color }};
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .svarakshit-faq-item details {
    width: 100%;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-item summary {
    padding: 24px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
  }
  
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-item summary::after {
    content: '+';
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1;
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-item details[open] summary::after {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-content {
    padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-content p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-wrapper {
      padding: 40px 1.5rem;
    }
    
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-header {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-header h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-item summary {
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .svarakshit-faq-content {
      padding: 0 20px 20px 20px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="svarakshit-faq-wrapper">
  <div class="svarakshit-faq-container">
    {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}
      <div class="svarakshit-faq-header">
        <h2>{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="svarakshit-faq-list">
      {% for block in section.blocks %}
        <div class="svarakshit-faq-item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <details>
            <summary>{{ block.settings.question }}</summary>
            <div class="svarakshit-faq-content">
              {{ block.settings.answer }}
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Swarakshit FAQ",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_color",
      "label": "Background Color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "item_bg_color",
      "label": "FAQ Card Background Color",
      "default": "#f7f7f7",
      "info": "Change to #2a2a2a for dark mode"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Text Color",
      "default": "#1a1a1a"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Frequently Asked Questions"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "faq_item",
      "name": "FAQ Item",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "question",
          "label": "Question",
          "default": "Question goes here?"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "answer",
          "label": "Answer",
          "default": "<p>Answer goes here.</p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Swarakshit FAQ",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which gases does it detect? (LPG, CNG, smoke?)",
            "answer": "<p>Swarakshit is engineered specifically to detect combustible gases like LPG (cylinder gas) and PNG/CNG (piped natural gas). Its highly calibrated sensors will trigger long before these gases reach explosive levels. Please note: it does <strong>not</strong> detect smoke or carbon monoxide (CO). It is designed to prevent gas leak disasters.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How hard is it to install?",
            "answer": "<p>Installation takes less than 2 minutes and requires zero technical expertise. It comes with a simple wall-mount bracket and double-sided adhesive. Just stick it to the wall near your gas cylinder or stove, plug it into a standard power outlet, and it begins monitoring immediately.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it work during a power outage?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! The Swarakshit runs on 2 AAA batteries, so it works completely independently of the power grid. Simply keep fresh batteries installed and the device is always ready to detect gas leaks — no charging or power outlet needed.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does the smart integration work?",
            "answer": "<p>Swarakshit connects seamlessly to your home Wi-Fi. Once linked to your network, if a leak is detected, the device will sound a piercing 85dB localized alarm while simultaneously pushing a high-priority notification directly to your devices—wherever you are in the world.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where is the best place to install the detector?",
            "answer": "<p>For optimal performance with LPG (which is heavier than air), install the detector low on the wall, about 1 foot above the floor and within 1-2 meters of your gas cylinder or stove. If using PNG (lighter than air), mount it higher up, about 1 foot below the ceiling.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does the battery last?",
            "answer": "<p>The internal battery provides 8–10 hours of continuous backup monitoring during a power cut. It charges automatically while plugged in, so it's always ready when you need it.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is there a warranty or return policy?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Every Swarakshit detector comes with a comprehensive 1-year manufacturer's warranty against defects. We also offer a 30-day return policy if you aren't completely satisfied with your purchase.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What happens if I change my Wi-Fi network?",
            "answer": "<p>If you get a new router or change your Wi-Fi password, simply reset the device's Wi-Fi settings using the reset button on the unit and follow the 60-second pairing process to connect it to your new network.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
